# What the package of Unity does not carry. The generator is published as the plugin which the package ships, so the
# project which built it - and this list itself - are none of them a part of what a consumer installs.
#
# The plumbing of the repository is not named here, because none of it is in this folder: the configuration of the
# repository, of the editor any of it is read in, and of what git leaves alone are one each at the root of the
# repository, and this is the folder a package manager is given.
Generator~
.npmignore
